    // inner is one of: assertion_declaration, range, symbol, class_content
    // Note: range/symbol/class_content branches include ";"? Actually our grammar: "not" ~ range ~ ";" etc. The ";" is anonymous string, not in inner. Good, inner is just range/symbol/class_content (and for assertion, assertion_declaration).
